          <div class="ocs-flow-step ocs-flow-done"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Delivered</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ocs-module-pills">
          <span class="ocs-mpill ocs-mpill-active">CRM</span><span class="ocs-mpill">Sales</span><span class="ocs-mpill ocs-mpill-active">Inventory</span><span class="ocs-mpill">Accounting</span><span class="ocs-mpill">HR</span><span class="ocs-mpill ocs-mpill-active">Manufacturing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ocs-float-badge ocs-float-1"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1265f3" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>Upgrade-Safe Code</div>
      <div class="ocs-float-badge ocs-float-2"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0bbf8a" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Free 14-Day Trial</div>
      <div class="ocs-float-badge ocs-float-3"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>4.9&#9733; Rated</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ocs-trust-bar">
  <div class="ocs-container">
    <p class="ocs-trust-label">Trusted by businesses across 25+ countries</p>
    <div class="ocs-logo-wrapper"><div class="ocs-logo-track"><div class="ocs-logo-item">TechCorp</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">RetailPro</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">ManufactureX</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">GlobalLogix</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">HealthPlus</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">BuildMaster</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">EduSuite</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">AgriTech</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">FinEdge</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">AutoDrive</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">TechCorp</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">RetailPro</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">ManufactureX</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">GlobalLogix</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">HealthPlus</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">BuildMaster</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">EduSuite</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">AgriTech</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">FinEdge</div><div class="ocs-logo-item">AutoDrive</div></div></div>
    <div class="ocs-stats-row">
      <div class="ocs-stat-item"><span class="ocs-stat-num ocs-counter" data-target="250">0</span><span class="ocs-stat-suf">+</span><span class="ocs-stat-lbl">Projects Delivered</span></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-div"></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-item"><span class="ocs-stat-num ocs-counter" data-target="100">0</span><span class="ocs-stat-suf">+</span><span class="ocs-stat-lbl">Happy Clients</span></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-div"></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-item"><span class="ocs-stat-num ocs-counter" data-target="15">0</span><span class="ocs-stat-suf">+</span><span class="ocs-stat-lbl">Industries Served</span></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-div"></div>
      <div class="ocs-stat-item"><span class="ocs-stat-num ocs-counter" data-target="8">0</span><span class="ocs-stat-suf">+</span><span class="ocs-stat-lbl">Years Experience</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ocs-section" id="ocs-challenges">
  <div class="ocs-container">
    <div class="ocs-section-header ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-slabel">The Problem</div><h2>Is Your ERP Holding Back Your Business?</h2><p>Generic ERP systems force your teams to adapt to the software. Here are the pain points we solve every day.</p></div>
    <div class="ocs-challenges-grid">
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-red"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/></svg></div><h3>Generic ERP Does Not Fit Your Workflow</h3><p>Standard modules force workarounds that slow teams down and create data inconsistencies across departments.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-orange"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg></div><h3>Too Many Manual Repetitive Tasks</h3><p>Hours wasted on data entry and copy-paste between systems that automation can eliminate entirely.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-purple"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Limited and Inflexible Reporting</h3><p>Default Odoo reports lack the depth and custom metrics your management team needs for strategic decisions.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-blue"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Complex Approval Process Bottlenecks</h3><p>Purchase orders and expense approvals bottleneck without automated routing to the right approvers.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-teal"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></div><h3>Missing Critical Integrations</h3><p>Disconnected apps create data silos. Your ecommerce, payments, logistics, and accounting do not talk to each other.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-challenge-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-cicon ocs-ci-rose"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg></div><h3>Scalability Bottlenecks</h3><p>As your business grows, your ERP struggles. Performance lags and inflexible architectures block expansion.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ocs-section ocs-why-bg" id="ocs-why">
  <div class="ocs-container">
    <div class="ocs-section-header ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-slabel">The Solution</div><h2>Why Odoo Customization Transforms Businesses</h2><p>Purpose-built Odoo customization aligns your ERP precisely with your workflows, teams, and growth ambitions.</p></div>
    <div class="ocs-benefits-grid">
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div><h3>Personalized Workflows</h3><p>Processes built around how your teams actually work, not around generic ERP logic.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></div><h3>Increased Productivity</h3><p>Automate repetitive tasks and eliminate manual work, freeing your team for high-value activities.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg></div><h3>Better User Experience</h3><p>Clean, intuitive interfaces designed for your users reduce training time and adoption resistance.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M4.93 4.93a10 10 0 0 0 0 14.14"/></svg></div><h3>Smart Automation</h3><p>Rules-based engines trigger automatic actions, emails, approvals, and data sync without human intervention.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></div><h3>Built to Scale</h3><p>Architecture designed to grow with your business. Add users, companies, and modules without rebuilding.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg></div><h3>Improved Decision Making</h3><p>Custom dashboards and real-time KPI reports give executives the exact data they need, when they need it.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg></div><h3>Industry-Specific Features</h3><p>Domain-specific modules built for your industry unique compliance and operational needs.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-benefit-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-bicon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div><h3>Reduced Operational Costs</h3><p>Eliminate software subscriptions, reduce headcount on manual tasks, and lower error-correction overhead.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ocs-section" id="ocs-services">
  <div class="ocs-container">
    <div class="ocs-section-header ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-slabel">Our Services</div><h2>Our Odoo Customization Services</h2><p>A complete spectrum of Odoo customization capabilities, from field-level tweaks to full custom module development and enterprise integrations.</p></div>
    <div class="ocs-services-grid">
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2H2v10l9.29 9.29c.94.94 2.48.94 3.42 0l6.58-6.58c.94-.94.94-2.48 0-3.42L12 2z"/><path d="M7 7h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Module Customization</h3><p>Modify existing Odoo modules to add fields, change behavior, extend views, and adapt logic to your unique requirements.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg></div><h3>Custom Module Development</h3><p>Build brand-new Odoo modules from scratch for business processes that standard Odoo does not cover out-of-the-box.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/></svg></div><h3>Workflow Automation</h3><p>Automate multi-step business processes including approvals, notifications, data sync, and scheduled actions.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></div><h3>Dashboard Customization</h3><p>Design custom KPI dashboards, pivot views, and real-time analytics tailored to executive and operational users.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg></div><h3>Report Customization</h3><p>Build pixel-perfect PDF reports, Excel exports, and custom analysis reports with advanced filters and groupings.</p></div>
      <div class="ocs-svc-card ocs-reveal"><div class="ocs-svc-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg></div><h3>UI/UX Customization</h3><p>Redesign Odoo interfaces, simplify complex forms, create user-friendly navigation and branded themes.</p></div>
